    <div class="mgdb-hero-body">
      <h1 id="amaizing-title">The AMAIZING European Maize Sequencing Project</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">
        De novo chromosome-scale genome assemblies and annotations for seven inbred lines in European breeding
      </p>

      <div class="amaizing-hero-actions-row">
        <a class="amaizing-hero-link" href="https://amaizing.fr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="amaizing-link-dot amaizing-dot-gold" aria-hidden="true"></span> Project website &#8599;
